+# BLUE CURRENT V51.25.0 — ROLE & PERMISSION CERTIFICATION
+
+V51.21–V51.25 certifies Blue Current's role, permission, membership, location-scope, and API authorization model before restaurant pilot use.
+
+## Permission hardening discovered during certification
+
+The V51.25 audit found a real authorization inconsistency:
+
+- the API already contained multiple `authService.can(auth,"admin")` guards
+- the existing AuthService did not grant the `admin` permission to either `owner` or `administrator`
+
+That made admin-only pilot controls unreachable through the intended owner/administrator roles.
+
+V51.25 fixes the permission source of truth before certification.
+
+## Explicit pilot permission matrix
+
+### Owner / Executive
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+- write
+- admin
+- write_operations
+- write_reservations
+- invite
+- switch_org
+- manage_users
+- manage_settings
+
+Scope:
+
+- portfolio / authorized organizations
+
+### Administrator
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+- write
+- admin
+- write_operations
+- write_reservations
+- invite
+- manage_users
+- manage_settings
+
+Denied:
+
+- switch_org unless organization membership flow explicitly grants it
+
+### General Manager
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+- write
+- write_operations
+- write_reservations
+- invite
+
+Denied:
+
+- admin
+- switch_org
+- manage_users
+- manage_settings
+
+### Host / Reservation Operator
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+- write_reservations
+
+Denied:
+
+- general write
+- admin
+- write_operations
+- user/settings management
+
+### Kitchen Manager
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+- write_operations
+
+Denied:
+
+- general write
+- admin
+- reservation-specific write
+- user/settings management
+
+### Staff
+
+Allowed:
+
+- read
+
+Denied:
+
+- write
+- admin
+- write_operations
+- write_reservations
+- user/settings management
+
+## Membership and location-scope certification
+
+V51.25 verifies:
+
+- membership role is recognized
+- every membership has a location scope
+- scoped location IDs exist
+- wildcard location scope is limited to owner/administrator roles
+- memberships link to active user identities
+- organization switching remains membership-bound
+
+## UI versus authorization
+
+Blue Current's role-experience UI is treated as presentation, not security.
+
+The API remains the authorization boundary.
+
+The certification exposes the intended UI profiles:
+
+- executive
+- manager
+- technical
+
+but hiding a UI section never substitutes for server-side authorization.
+
+## Human certification
+
+Adds:
+
+GET `/api/role-permission-certification`
+
+POST `/api/role-permission-certification/certify`
+
+Final certification requires:
+
+- all role-matrix gates pass
+- all membership/location-scope gates pass
+- identity linkage passes
+- cross-organization membership boundary passes
+- V51 data-integrity prerequisite is ready
+- admin permission
+- human evidence
+- human certification note
+
+Certified state:
+
+`ROLE_PERMISSION_CERTIFIED`
+
+## Current authenticated Chefs runtime
+
+Before recording certification, the current authoritative configuration reports:
+
+- `role-permission-ready-for-certification`
+- system gates: 5/5
+- role profiles: 6/6
+- Chefs membership scopes: 2/2
+- owner admin permission reachable: true
+- administrator admin permission reachable: true
+
+Current Chefs memberships:
+
+- owner — portfolio wildcard scope
+- general manager — Marina Grille scoped access
+
+The deterministic role test verifies that the general manager does not receive admin permission.
+
+## Safety policy
+
+- API is the authorization boundary
+- UI visibility is not authorization
+- least privilege required
+- cross-location isolation required
+- cross-organization membership required
+- human certification required
+- automatic role escalation false
+- automatic scope expansion false
+- autonomous permission changes false
+
+## Validation
+
+- V51.25 focused role/permission lifecycle PASS
+- owner admin reachability PASS
+- administrator admin reachability PASS
+- GM write-without-admin boundary PASS
+- host reservation boundary PASS
+- kitchen operations boundary PASS
+- staff read-only boundary PASS
+- membership/location-scope validation PASS
+- cross-organization membership boundary PASS
+- V51.20 regression PASS
+- authenticated owner/admin certification route PASS
+- authoritative database unchanged
+- undefined module exports: 0
+- duplicate HTML IDs: 0
+- npm run check PASS
+- 932 JavaScript files
+- 780 client scripts
+- 5,816 unique HTML IDs
+
+## Next
+
+V51.26–V51.30 — Operator UX Hardening
+
+- identify high-friction pilot workflows
+- reduce unnecessary clicks
+- remove duplicate/conflicting actions
+- strengthen information hierarchy
+- improve readability under service conditions
+- normalize terminology
+- surface primary actions first
+- reduce cognitive load
+- improve keyboard/fast-action flows
+- certify operator usability without redesigning proven functionality
